@@ -0,0 +1,110 @@
+# Copyright (C) 2009-2021, Ecole Polytechnique Federale de Lausanne (EPFL) and
+# Hospital Center and University of Lausanne (UNIL-CHUV), Switzerland, and CMP3 contributors
+# All rights reserved.
